/fluxer_native/fluxerd

# Fork: since upstream's da7c73d27e (#3989) the desktop crates are members of the root Cargo
# workspace, and cargo loads every member in an image that builds a Rust service, while the
# `/fluxer_desktop/` line above leaves them out of the context (tyne-chat/tyne#592). Their sources
# come back in, without their build output. Drop this once upstream's list lets them in.
!/fluxer_desktop/native/
/fluxer_desktop/native/**/target/
/fluxer_desktop/native/**/node_modules/
